<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified its operations in southern Lebanon, striking Qantara, conducting overflights that wounded a Lebanese footballer, and detonating a large explosion in Khiam while drones flew over Beirut. The Lebanese army seized a large quantity of weapons in a Beirut suburb warehouse and reported another arms depot capture in the city’s southern suburbs. Hezbollah arrested five members in Batroun, continued artillery fire on Israeli positions, and began cash payments to war victims and displaced families. UNRWA funding cuts have deepened hardship for Palestinian refugees in Lebanon. 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOSzBYVTZaWEE5UlVZVlFscjNtUkFERXhGcEtUdEdSN2V6THd6cGszaHVxNUgzT2RxcGNWU296VS16T2Q1Q0ltWUt0eDBfVTRaMW5WdWVBY0RRYnlVZFg4RnotVkFKODhOUTBMMUJSY2V3UGFibVpCci1qNk5qdHk5QTVNb0JUbHlJenI1NG9KMEpYWUNZX1gzMjY2dk8xT1NLTk82Smh1Z3lQalp6bDlpOF9UdGptU3JhUnZtSUQ3aHl1cHFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQdzVmLUxyUXY0OGRNR1B1N3dDWGNfcDI5bVVuOVlRS3pUU1doSlpCVmR3aXJ1NVMwWEV0WF9IRFV1MnlhdGJfVTZPOUZFMjBXcERiMVlqUkVmSVR4M0h3M2FoeXFHdnRpVEdVNThteVBTcjNHbVNrN1ZkNXhrUHhyRC1QbHB5NWR1N0xQS1JGcmgydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Muslim News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNTFVYMTZnLXQwVWRyRE1VVmt6MzduLVhwbkhNUzhOcTNYNHNaNlhoMGR0T2ZmSTJYN28xSnQ5Z1lRTk